WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,560
Why, that rag-tag fishing thing scares me?

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,560
If you have the guts, just do it

3
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:16,590
crazy madman

4
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:29,000
Congratulations to the owner for meeting the vitality requirements

5
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:34,090
Are you in a hurry?

6
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:53,570
How did it happen

7
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,300
This man is very mysterious

8
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:57,380
Don't offend and don't ask too many questions

9
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:00,930
Fortunately, I recognize these and no one can take them away.

10
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:12,930
Yaya don’t cry Yaya

11
00:01:12,930 --> 00:01:16,100
Brother, I miss you too. My parents left early.

12
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:18,940
This woman has been dependent on me since she was a child, and these days are the last days

13
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:20,540
I don’t know how much she suffered alone.

14
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:22,460
It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.

15
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:29,250
I've been waiting for you here

16
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,490
You, a woman, have been sensible since you were a child.

17
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,120
When has it been?

18
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,480
Still holding a broken jar

19
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,300
It's not a broken jar

20
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:39,700
It's packed in here

21
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,180
It’s the wealth that my brother has saved so hard over the years.

22
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:43,700
The day of the flood

23
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,860
I went back to the room to pack my things

24
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:48,020
But Sister Luyao came from outside

25
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,300
Locked the door

26
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,980
He also said I was a thunder cone

27
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:59,100
It was you Luyao that day
